1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:19,325
In a sensational development, a spokesperson for the giant steel-making corporation IZH, which until recently has been considered one of the driving forces behind Canada's industrial growth, announced that IZH's board of directors has suspended the Chief Executive Officer and the head of financial services.

2
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:24,825
The spokesperson declined to answer questions or go into details regarding the suspension.

3
00:00:25,765 --> 00:00:28,670
However, we have learned of several relevant facts.

4
00:00:29,305 --> 00:00:35,085
Our senior business and finance editor has contacted a senior member of IZH's Accounting Department.

5
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:43,205
This person, who wishes to remain anonymous at present, has provided details of an alleged large-scale accounting fraud.

6
00:00:44,605 --> 00:00:50,645
Federal police and tax agents have begun an investigation which may take months, if not years, to complete.
